{"title": "Stop First, Then Size", "type": "One trick", "hooks": ["Don't pick your size first. Pick your stop, then size the trade.", "Stop choosing how many shares first. Choose the stop.", "Three stops, one trade. Only one of them makes sense."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Stop choosing how many shares first. Choose the stop.", "text": "Stop first. Then size.", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "question", "chart": 0, "badge": "Q1", "head": "Where's the stop?", "vo": "You buy this bounce off support. Where does the stop go? Far below, just below support, or a hair under entry?", "win": [20, 115], "options": ["Far below, so it is never hit", "Just below the support, outside the usual noise", "A hair below the entry, to lose as little as possible"], "answer": 1, "show": 90, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "options"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 23.68, "label": "Support", "tone": "level"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 23.65, "label": "Entry", "tone": "entry"}]}, {"kind": "answer", "chart": 0, "head": "Just below support", "vo": "Just below support, where the idea is proved wrong. Here it was hit after two candles. The tight one went after one.", "win": [20, 115], "reveal_to": 115, "carry": true, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 23.61, "label": "Below support", "tone": "stop"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 23.63, "label": "Tight", "tone": "stop"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 22.96, "label": "Wide", "tone": "stop"}]}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "Why not the others?", "vo": "A stop inside the normal noise gets hit by chance. A stop far away makes each loss so big the position has to be tiny.", "items": [{"text": "Too tight", "sub": "hit by ordinary noise", "icon": "cross"}, {"text": "Too wide", "sub": "forces a tiny position", "icon": "warn"}], "cues": [{"say": "inside the normal noise", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "far away", "do": "item", "i": 1}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Stop first. Then size.", "vo": "So the stop comes first. Then size the position so that hitting it is a loss you can take.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Practise the order", "vo": "Follow for more, and practise sizing trades at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Don't pick your size first. Pick your stop, then size the trade.\nA stop goes where the trade idea is proved wrong: here, just below support.\nToo tight, and noise hits it. Too wide, and the position has to be tiny.\nSize the position from the stop, not the other way round.\nFollow for one chart rule a day.\nPractise at memestreet.net\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n#MemeStreet #StopLoss #PositionSizing #RiskManagement", "charts": [{"candles": [[21.64, 21.64, 21.6, 21.63, 4593669], [21.63, 21.75, 21.63, 21.7, 5336189], [21.71, 21.8, 21.4, 21.57, 16423874], [21.56, 21.6, 21.42, 21.42, 9344354], [21.43, 21.57, 21.38, 21.48, 18325261], [21.48, 21.5, 21.29, 21.43, 12458129], [21.43, 21.46, 21.41, 21.43, 3137854], [21.43, 21.47, 21.43, 21.46, 2343297], [21.43, 21.64, 21.39, 21.57, 11152602], [21.57, 21.65, 21.48, 21.52, 11539863], [21.52, 21.6, 21.39, 21.6, 7436973], [21.6, 21.6, 21.4, 21.46, 10822104], [21.46, 21.51, 21.43, 21.51, 2700530], [21.51, 21.52, 21.46, 21.49, 4687179], [21.49, 21.74, 21.42, 21.65, 13411238], [21.65, 21.8, 21.65, 21.77, 4428185], [21.77, 21.95, 21.75, 21.9, 8139412], [21.9, 21.92, 21.82, 21.89, 3897980], [21.89, 21.92, 21.89, 21.92, 726926], [21.92, 21.92, 21.9, 21.9, 943837], [21.99, 22.02, 21.96, 21.96, 3018995], [21.96, 22.0, 21.94, 21.94, 2775147], [21.94, 21.94, 21.88, 21.92, 2028156], [21.92, 22.05, 21.91, 22.0, 2714967], [22.0, 22.0, 21.98, 21.99, 561533], [21.99, 22.02, 21.99, 22.02, 342246], [21.97, 22.18, 21.97, 22.17, 2719597], [22.17, 22.18, 22.15, 22.15, 1666491], [22.15, 22.16, 22.11, 22.12, 1662240], [22.12, 22.17, 22.12, 22.16, 2334496], [22.16, 22.17, 22.15, 22.15, 914445], [22.15, 22.16, 22.12, 22.15, 1201092], [22.12, 22.18, 22.03, 22.11, 5901140], [